          "text": "<p><a title=\"Open Vocear Analytics PDF\" href=\"/content/dam/stryker/acute-care/vocera/legal/vocera-alarm-analytics.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Vocera Alarm Analytics</a></p>\n<p><a title=\"Open Vocera Alarm Management PDF\" href=\"/content/dam/stryker/acute-care/vocera/legal/vocera-alarm-management.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Vocera Alarm Management</a></p>\n<p><a title=\"Open Vocera Badge Firmware PDF\" href=\"/content/dam/stryker/acute-care/vocera/legal/vocera-badge-firmware.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Vocera Badge Firmware</a></p>\n<p><a title=\"Open Vocera Cardiac Consult\" href=\"/content/dam/stryker/acute-care/vocera/legal/vocera-cardiac-consult.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Vocera Cardiac Consult</a></p>\n<p><a title=\"Open Vocera Care Experience PDF\" href=\"/content/dam/stryker/acute-care/vocera/legal/vocera-care-experience.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Vocera Care Experience</a></p>\n<p><a title=\"Open Vocera Clinical Workflow Engine PDF\" href=\"/content/dam/stryker/acute-care/vocera/legal/vocera-clinical-workflow-engine.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Vocera Clinical Workflow Engine</a><br>\n(including Patient Monitoring Connector)</p>\n<p><a title=\"Open Vocera Engage Platform PDF\" href=\"/content/dam/stryker/acute-care/vocera/legal/vocera-engage-platform.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Vocera Engage Platform</a><br>\n(including Airstrip)</p>\n<p><a title=\"Open Vocera Engage Platform PDF\" href=\"/content/dam/stryker/acute-care/vocera/legal/vocera-integrations.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Vocera Integrations</a><br>\n(including Vocera Care Team Synchronization and Vocera Environmental Services)</p>\n<p><a title=\"Open Vocera Messaging Platform PDF\" href=\"/content/dam/stryker/acute-care/vocera/legal/vocera-messaging-platform.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Vocera Messaging Platform</a></p>\n<p><a title=\"Open Vocera Smartphone Applications PDF\" href=\"/content/dam/stryker/acute-care/vocera/legal/vocera-smartphone-applications.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Vocera Smartphone Applications</a><br>\n(including Vocera Collaboration Suite and Vocera Secure Texting)</p>\n<p><a title=\"Open Vocera Voice Server PDF\" href=\"/content/dam/stryker/acute-care/vocera/legal/vocera-voice-server.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Vocera Voice Server</a></p>\n",
